* {{lb|en|rare}} {{l|en|baby sitter}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|baby|sitter}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈbeɪbiˌsɪtɚ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s}}

# A person who [[care]]s for one or more [[baby|babies]] or [[child]]ren for a short period of time in place of their [[guardian|legal guardian]]s.
#: {{syn|en|sitter}}, {{hyper|en|childminder}}
#: {{ux|en|My neighbor is sometimes a '''babysitter''' for other moms' children.}}

